# The sweep fixtures carry a mixed form on purpose: an LF header followed by CRLF data rows. No
# sweep writes it - `SweepReport.write` writes LF throughout - but the reader accepts it, and these
# fixtures are the proof. The repo's own `* text=auto eol=lf` would normalize them to pure LF on the
# next checkout, which would quietly delete the thing they exist to pin - test_sweep asserts the
# CRLF is there.
#
# `-text` stores and checks out their bytes verbatim. Do not remove this without also deciding that
# the reader need not prove it tolerates the mixed form.
sweep-*.tsv -text
